  "body": "Adds a CAM fundamentals section to the guide: `site/content/guide/fundamentals/` with a section index and eight pages, plus a short paragraph in `site/content/guide/_index.md` linking it.\n\nPages: `feeds-and-speeds`, `tool-selection`, `toolpath-strategy`, `rigidity`, `chips-and-coolant`, `surface-finish`, `proving-out`, `post-and-machine`. Each states the general principle (formulas and habits only, no vendor tables), then what CamCraft does.\n\n**Claims checked against upstream/main (0757563d):** Feeds tab fields and the \"Suggest feeds & speeds\" / \"Apply suggestion\" flow (`ui/.../feeds_page.rs`, `app/src/cutting.rs`, `tools/src/cutting.rs`), machine rpm/power checks (`app/src/machine/mod.rs`), the lathe-only workholding rpm limit (`app/src/setup_workholding.rs`), drill reach and holder laws (`operation/drill_reach.rs`), verify warnings and which block the post (`sim/src/verify/types.rs`, `blocks_post`), coolant modes (Off, Flood, Mist, Through tool), 3D finish patterns, Rest roughing, tab settings, start blocks and G21 in `assets/posts/fanuc.cps` / `haas.cps`, the Carvera inch warning.\n\n**Stated as not implemented (no feature found):** tool deflection or chatter model, an air-blast coolant mode, a smallest-inside-radius report, reading tolerances from the model, inch program output as a document setting (open #902).\n\n**Links:** existing pages use `@/` links. Pages that only exist in open PRs (#1252, #1258, #1259, #1267, #1269, #1271, #1272, #1283) are linked by their final site URL (https://neotech.github.io/Camcraft/guide/<page>/), not `@/`, so this PR builds before they merge. They 404 until those PRs merge; they could be switched to `@/` after.\n\n**Tested:** `zola build` in `site/` succeeds (19 pages, 3 sections). `zola check` reports only those pending-PR links as broken; every other link resolves.\n\n**Not exercised:** no rendered visual check in a browser. The guide `_index.md` edit may conflict trivially with #1252/#1259/#1271, which also edit it.\n\nEffort: medium\nChangelog: none\nFixes #1281\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL\n",
